{"title":"1964 IMO Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Ravi_Substitution)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Ravi Substitution)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5_(Ravi&#39;s_-_Muirhead&#39;s)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5 (Ravi's - Muirhead's)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc6d9a6172d35127b6cb37ea92192caf7029a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> are the sides of a triangle. Prove that \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/c/8/2c8afb405fe890dd89759ea3a2ed2e527038adfc.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2(b+c-a)+b^2(c+a-b)+c^2(a+b-c)\\le{3abc}.\\]\" width=\"405\" height=\"19\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/8/a886fd804e1f4669162f0e792220550be117451c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+c-a = x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"106\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/f/7af55c966eed58a530184dc845123e4c031ea337.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c+a-b = y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"18\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/b/7/5b7f621dbfd1a007f7cc1aebc9a167546f6bf245.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b-c = z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"16\" />. Then, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/b/b4bee3ce1d476671b9d3c377410654e93fe8cef4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{y+z}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"81\" height=\"37\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/8/5e8213145b9d5608a2a8d7126da88cd5504bc2e7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = \\frac{x+z}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"80\" height=\"37\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/8/808fdf16d26107cb0e810fb223417490768d48bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = \\frac{x+y}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"80\" height=\"37\" />. By AM-GM, \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/b/dbbbec16dcb8a296b18f0f27af022d91a5b8c356.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x+y}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{xy},\\]\" width=\"107\" height=\"35\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/e/cfed5cdca9b7fd9834c947d1a7021ee5df21d500.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{y+z}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{yz},\\]\" width=\"105\" height=\"35\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/2/2f2846bf665638e8b929129491bf2d813cc40b11.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\textrm{and }\\frac{x+z}{2} \\geq \\sqrt{xz}.\\]\" width=\"140\" height=\"35\" />\n</p><p>Multiplying these equations, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/4/7a4e4c7005b57bb08004083175b3dd3a3d6fc9ae.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x+y}{2} \\cdot \\frac{y+z}{2} \\cdot \\frac{x+z}{2} \\geq xyz\\]\" width=\"214\" height=\"35\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/0/a/f0ae2bd3e6a36696d11d095be34fd7f5d54c8164.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\therefore abc \\geq (a+b-c)(b+c-a)(c+a-b).\\]\" width=\"321\" height=\"18\" />\nWe can now simplify:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/5/0/7505abb3b85d47c1c911b3a512f7dbea09edef79.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a+b-c)(b+c-a)(c+a-b) \\leq abc\\]\" width=\"299\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/a/54ae25913870858066cf7ea7db8b52b0986240a7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(-a^2 + b^2 - c^2 + 2ac)(c+a-b) \\leq abc\\]\" width=\"301\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/b/50bd407289b1dfc13a02a29cf680b02b7b4e97e4.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a(-a^2 + b^2 - c^2 + 2ac) + c(-a^2 + b^2 - c^2 + 2ac) - b(-a^2 + b^2 - c^2 + 2ac) \\leq abc\\]\" width=\"537\" height=\"20\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/f/01f17474eaebc642cbe91ebcde5e79464aa95046.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-a^3 + ab^2 - ac^2 + 2a^2c - a^2c + b^2c - c^3 + 2ac^2 + a^2b - b^3 + bc^2 - 2abc \\leq abc\\]\" width=\"513\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/a/b7acb76cb4da1cbd5c46ae648f782c8a8cc75285.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2b + a^2c - a^3 + b^2c + ab^2 - b^3 + ac^2 + bc^2 - c^3 - 2abc \\leq abc\\]\" width=\"477\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/2/9c2073b73bee2f0ec5cab0a7604ce5492bab776b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2(b+c-a)+b^2(c+a-b)+c^2(a+b-c)\\le{3abc}\\textrm{. }\\square\\]\" width=\"426\" height=\"20\" />\n~mathboy100\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Ravi_Substitution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Ravi_Substitution)\">Solution 2 (Ravi Substitution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Ravi Substitution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use the substitution <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/0/ee0c8b7e3686e9ab560ffebe4901cf527e19c1c6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"75\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/7/a2789cd7f7c834a9419744f85022803d1df444f0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=x+z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"16\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/600a0b1f1cd16b1005775084f1d648f5a3d82d31.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=y+z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" /> to get\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/2/6522426f4f40387f35379270676d7bcd6ef21add.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2z(x+y)^2+2y(x+z)^2+2x(y+z)^2\\leq 3(x+y)(x+z)(y+z)\\]\" width=\"478\" height=\"19\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/8/f/88fefbb7a5a90e752f36871908fb6fbe25463412.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2zx^2+2zy^2+2yx^2+2yz^2+2xy^2+2xz^2+12xyz\\leq 3x^2y+3x^2z+3y^2x+3y^2z+3z^2x+3z^2y+6xyz$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"808\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/c/44c76b06c472625ded2773717bcfa933af468183.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x^2y+x^2z+y^2x+y^2z+z^2x+z^2y\\geq 6xyz\\]\" width=\"334\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/c/d7cdaef5d710f396683d10490561a1d321effebb.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{x^2y+x^2z+y^2x+y^2z+z^2x+z^2y}{6}\\geq xyz=\\sqrt[6]{x^2yx^2zy^2xy^2zz^2xz^2y}\\]\" width=\"532\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>This is true by AM-GM. We can work backwards to get that the original inequality is true.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rearrange to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/c/0dcd3e5fa64e8656215b2e2662a9f90f74cd08cd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a(a-b)(a-c) + b(b-a)(b-c) + c(c-a)(c-b) \\ge 0,\\]\" width=\"426\" height=\"18\" />\nwhich is true by Schur's inequality.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/c/acc6d9a6172d35127b6cb37ea92192caf7029a54.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"43\" height=\"18\" /> are the sides of a triangle doesn't do anything except telling you <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/5/c45101856b20fa213f091cc0f47ecaea56fcfeee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b+c-a, c+a-b, a+b-c, a, b, c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"277\" height=\"18\" /> are all positive numbers (by triangle inequality). Once we established this, the problem become an ordinary inequality problem that will potentially have many ways to solve. Here is one solution:\n</p><p>We aim to prove: \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/4/02426521b76b5ca5b957dfd14acf0f82506d8382.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2(b+c-a)+b^2(c+a-b)+c^2(a+b-c)\\le{3abc} \\Rightarrow a^3+b^3+c^3+3abc \\geq a^2b+a^2c+b^2c+b^2a+c^2a+c^2b\\]\" width=\"731\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>(Here already we can finish the proof by Schur's inequality)\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/1/c/21cdb8d559239e76ae9420498aae5c196f976baf.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\Rightarrow a^3+b^3+c^3+6abc \\geq (a+b+c)(ab+bc+ca)\\]\" width=\"387\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>This is homogeneous as both sides have the degree of 3. WLOG, we can thus let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/c/9/ec972889b44f27273e420e9d5228d95ff7e65407.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a+b+c = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"102\" height=\"14\" />, then the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/e/4ee0b72744b0eafc277947acdb4d0af060dd5be0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$RHS = ab+bc+ca$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"164\" height=\"16\" />.\n</p><p>The <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/2/152b48b9e934b07fef52379ee39a7c410b93e8b6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$LHS = (a+b+c)(a^2+b^2+c^2-ab-bc-ca)+9abc = a^2+b^2+c^2-ab-bc-ca+9abc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"721\" height=\"21\" />.\n</p><p>We need to prove <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/7/1d79559c3ded5b336daee3a5d5efc9cf3e4ffee3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[LHS \\geq RHS \\Rightarrow a^2+b^2+c^2-2ab-2bc-2ca+9abc = 1-4(ab+bc+ca)+9abc\\]\" width=\"578\" height=\"20\" />\n</p><p>Using Lagrange multiplier, let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/3/f/73faba5ff6f4f006662a893b965923f83de4d486.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x) = 1-4(ab+bc+ca)+9abc+\\lambda(a+b+c-1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"416\" height=\"20\" />, then we take the partial derivatives to obtain the four equations:\n</p><p>\\begin{cases}\n\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial a} =        -4(b+c)+9bc+\\lambda = 0\n\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial b} =        -4(a+c)+9ac+\\lambda = 0\n\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial c} =        -4(a+b)+9ab+\\lambda = 0\n\\frac{\\partial f}{\\partial \\lambda} = a+b+c-1 = 0\n\\end{cases}\n</p><p>Solving the system, we obtained <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/c/b7cdbb2d170d9280d3a71e9a2722c309b6d69c4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=b=c=\\frac{1}{3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"113\" height=\"38\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/3/0/f30dd098a01c554ae035ee139215c1f6e74a6648.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c = \\{5/18,5/18,4/9\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"202\" height=\"20\" />. Checking the boundaries we can also obtain <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/7/0/f70e345e1b5a9fbd8a13181a4825d876dbba0c1a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a,b,c = \\{0,1/2,1/2\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"165\" height=\"20\" />, testing the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/8/408c210aae0128ee5516d3b6f96a8a5fd98174a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a,b,c)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"68\" height=\"20\" />, we find that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/d/2/5d2a984a61e5d73fe521456eac110374b3167d1d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(a,b,c) \\geq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"102\" height=\"20\" />, and we are done.\n</p>\n<ul><li>We can verify that the interior stationary point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/a/dea438f3477da6ebdef05144fa2509bd728cf597.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1/3, 1/3, 1/3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"114\" height=\"20\" /> is indeed a minimum by hessian matrix</li></ul>\n<p>~<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=User:IDKHowtoaddsolution&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"User:IDKHowtoaddsolution (page does not exist)\">IDKHowtoaddsolution</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_5_.28Ravi.27s_-_Muirhead.27s.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5_(Ravi's_-_Muirhead's)\">Solution 5 (Ravi's - Muirhead's)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5 (Ravi&#39;s - Muirhead&#39;s)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Apply Ravi’s Transformation for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/f/a1f9c080cd716ab04afe754dc2e6673f7f014b78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = x+y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"16\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/2/57218c545aca2f7b2101fed0d8fcb529a4071d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = y+z$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/6/eb6fd11de3b7c88753c8ef2bb1c2acdc3f33cd04.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=z+x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/2/e220b69c1d6d4b6afdcdd976b1ab7c6f3d27738f.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{cyc} (x^2+2xy+y^2)(2z) \\leq 3(\\sum_{sym} x^2y + 2xyz)\\]\" width=\"342\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/0/8a06e3b11227546d74d3d620eccf8814ebe1a2a7.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2\\sum_{sym} x^2y + 12xyz \\leq 3\\sum_{sym} x^2y + 6xyz\\]\" width=\"289\" height=\"39\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/2/a/22a19c50bd8f19ec4348b9a0bb3ba14ed3eb61e3.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[6xyz \\leq \\sum_{sym} x^2y\\]\" width=\"117\" height=\"39\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/c/9ec7e9f76c353fb55f825e6a34741d237e12ba88.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sum_{sym} xyz \\leq \\sum_{sym} x^2y\\]\" width=\"137\" height=\"39\" />\n</p><p>Through Muirhead, as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/f/f8ff70c7929fbfa570d964a64cd4238a5fd97dc0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1,1,1) \\prec (2,1,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"141\" height=\"20\" />, the result follows. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/c/b6cf65b1f2fbdf388e3daeff9b96b34d3399d777.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\square$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Expanding the identity is equivalent to \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/4/a446a80b7c10705a9db0471413fedfd62b985d62.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a^2 b + ab^2 + b^2 c + bc^2 + c^2 a + ca^2 - a^3 - b^3 - c^3 \\leq 3abc. \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ (1)\\]\" width=\"483\" height=\"20\" />\nNote <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/d/2/4d256b644e48b5e47ff9d3caa076ac00bd9e45e2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a+b)(b+c)(c+a) = 2abc + a^2 b + a b^2 + b^2 c + bc^2 + c^2 a + ca^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"499\" height=\"21\" />. Thus <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/9/0d9c3b1c142cbd3f8217dabc160c57e4750df241.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"18\" /> is equivalent to \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/3/8/838b02f19b7d11919c2da881f1a50711c4594b86.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(a+b)(b+c)(c+a)-5abc \\leq a^3 + b^3 + c^3. \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ (2)\\]\" width=\"385\" height=\"20\" />\nWLOG <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/4/e/b4eb173fd518ca131dac2a900d0ed8d158865e78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a \\leq b \\leq c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"15\" />. Then \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/e/bbebd71fa894467921fc83d3ec856fcbc95e2ddd.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\text{LHS of } (2) \\leq bc^2 - 5abc = bc(c-5a) \\leq c^3 \\leq a^3 + b^3 + c^3\\]\" width=\"441\" height=\"20\" />\nso we are done.\n</p><p>~not_detriti\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/6gDLBT1aGQM?si=ZR78mdotq4wfS3SA&amp;t=637\">https://youtu.be/6gDLBT1aGQM?si=ZR78mdotq4wfS3SA&amp;t=637</a> [little fermat]\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO\" title=\"1964 IMO\">1964 IMO</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems\" title=\"1964 IMO Problems\">Problems</a></b>) • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c3222\">Resources</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1964 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"34%\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1964 IMO Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1964 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1964 IMO Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1964 IMO Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1964 IMO Problems/Problem 6\">6</a>\n</td>\n<td width=\"33%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1964_IMO_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1964 IMO Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=IMO_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"IMO Problems and Solutions\"> All IMO Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017110435\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.036 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.063 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 336/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 895/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 44/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 11267/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   21.291      1 Template:IMO_box\n100.00%   21.291      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:8265:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017110435 and revision id 290223. Rendering was triggered be